 "segments": [
  {
   "text": "Stop using Claude like Google. Here are five things I use it for every day, while preparing for a thirty L P A job.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 7.488
  },
  {
   "text": "Number one. It plans my day. My sixteen-week plan becomes today's to-do list, right inside Notion.",
   "start": 8.266,
   "end": 15.534
  },
  {
   "text": "Number two. Hints, not answers. Stuck on a DSA problem? I ask for one hint, then I try again.",
   "start": 16.347,
   "end": 24.276
  },
  {
   "text": "Number three. It explains every concept using my own project, the chat app I'm building.",
   "start": 25.019,
   "end": 31.033
  },
  {
   "text": "Number four. It reviews my code like a senior developer, before any interviewer sees it.",
   "start": 31.927,
   "end": 37.477
  },
  {
   "text": "Number five. It checks on me at 2 AM, and tells me exactly what I haven't finished.",
   "start": 38.313,
   "end": 44.245
  },
  {
   "text": "It doesn't do the work for me. It makes sure I do it.",
   "start": 44.988,
   "end": 48.309
  },
  {
   "text": "Comment the word prompts, and I'll send you all five.",
   "start": 49.064,
   "end": 52.93
  }
 ],
